l4lim_screen: Layer 4 task L4A-101, the limiter window screen before L4A-56 and L4A-57 (W127's finding 3; MESHSAT-1357)
prototype design; nothing built, bought, powered or measured; nothing applied to the tree; a SCREEN, not an acceptance: it closes no
cx46 item, accepts nothing and moves no state (cx46 CORRECTIONS NOT CLOSED and Layer 4's DESK gate NOT PASSED stand)

